        "verdict": "approve",
        "summary": "The implementation matches the required persistence order, forced-receipt retirement, reason propagation, review-record hash/round format, legacy decoding, and commit-failure recovery. The supplied tests cover the requested behavior.",
        "findings": [
          {
            "severity": "nit",
            "file": "internal/cli/cmd_review_test.go",
            "line": 67,
            "title": "Legacy coverage was added as a new top-level test",
            "detail": "The task says every new test belongs in cmd_review_failure_test.go and asks for the legacy-file scenario as an added case in the existing round-trip test. Keep this package-private coverage in cmd_review_test.go, but fold it into TestWriteResultJSONRoundTripsFindings rather than introducing a separate test function."
          }
        ],
